      "writtenOn": "2014-07-16T16:40:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is last_tx_ok doing?  It seems like it will be set to false on a timeout, and then the next transaction will always be dropped (because the else below just updates last_tx_ok without actually doing the transfer), even if it might have been successfully queued.  It seems unneeded.",
