        "id": 1001139
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-07-16T17:30:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The host might not be receiving data, and in this case, we don\u0027t want every call to time out after USB_CONSOLE_TIMEOUT_US. Otherwise, this blocks console output and makes UART console very slow. Added comment on this.",
